{"lang":"so","dir":"ltr","text":{"credits.donateTitle":"Naga caawi in waxbarashadu sii ahaato bilaash","credits.donateButton":"Taageer AOSSIE","credits.data":"Xogta","credits.photos":"Sawirrada caasimadaha","credits.otherPhotos":"Sawirrada miraha, xayawaanka iyo macdanta","madeBy":"waxaa sameeyay"},"html":{"credits.lead":"Memo waa barnaamij bilaash ah oo il-furan, waxaana sameeyay <a href=\"https://aossie.org/\">AOSSIE</a>.","credits.source":"Koodhka isha: <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame\">github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame</a>.","credits.donateText":"AOSSIE waa urur aan faa’iido doon ahayn. Memo ma laha xayeysiis, ma laha is-diiwaangelin lacag ah, mana ururiso xogtaada — waxaanan rabnaa inay sidaas ku sii ahaato ilmo kasta, meel kasta. Haddii Memo ay carruurtaada ka dhigtay kuwo xiiseeya adduunka, fadlan ka fikir inaad noo iibiso koob qaxwo ah: deeq kasta, si kasta oo ay u yar tahay, waxay naga caawisaa inaan dhisno oo dayactirno barnaamijyo waxbarasho oo bilaash ah oo badan. Ka qaybgalka kood, fikrado, tarjumaad iyo jawaab-celin sidoo kale waa lagu soo dhoweynayaa!","credits.shapes":"Sawirrada qaababka: waxaa loo sawiray Memo, waana bilaash in la isticmaalo sida inta kale ee app-ka.","credits.photoSets":"Sawirrada miraha, xayawaanka iyo macdanta: waxay ka yimaadeen <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, waxaana lagu doortay <a href=\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\">Wikipedia</a> iyo <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>; magacyadooda luqad kasta: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0).","credits.flags":"Calamada: waxay ka yimaadeen <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, oo ka soo qaata <a href=\"https://github.com/hampusborgos/country-flags\">hampusborgos/country-flags</a> (hanti guud).","credits.capitals":"Caasimadaha iyo sawirradooda: waxay ka yimaadeen <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, oo ka soo qaata <a href=\"h